  根因

  1. Cache schema 冻结（直接触发 KeyError）

  TrajectoryCache (rlinf/data/storage/replay/buffer.py) 在第一次 put 时用 _alloc_buffer_like 按该条 flat traj 的 key 建 buffer；之后 
  _insert_into_buffer 假定 key 集合不变：

   rlinf/data/storage/replay/buffer.py lines 96-102

      def _insert_into_buffer(self, trajectory: dict, buffer: dict, start: int) -> None:
          for key, value in trajectory.items():
              if isinstance(value, torch.Tensor):
                  end = start + value.shape[0]
                  buffer[key][start:end] = value
              elif isinstance(value, dict):
                  self._insert_into_buffer(value, buffer[key], start)

  B1 的 future 字段不是 rollout 原始字段，而是 actor 侧后加的：

   rlinf/workers/actor/fsdp_rlt_ac_policy_worker.py lines 768-779

